From ec5f3da8c080271ca812c6f77e9b4c1bf68e5d50 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:27:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Spec 34 phase 1: aliasing attributes, development mode,
 O3, per-function/file optimization, float modes

- mut T& (and mut this) are noalias; T& of frozen types is noalias readonly
- std::build::mode::development (debug + basic optimization), optimization::basic (O1)
- release optimizes at O3
- @std::optimize{ .level } and g.optimize_files(t, pattern, level); optnone honored
- @std::float_mode{ ... } fast-math flags per function; float_determinism() mode setting

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q8pVznAZ1y3sWL44jCSxLp
